              "text": "59",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "waleeta Jokebedi mukaana wa Levi wivulwa mu kivala cha Egebeti. Yivulira Amuramu avayaayi vaviri Haruni na Musa, nu mukaana Miriamu. ",
          "type": "text",
